---
import imageRocket from "../assets/Startup_Monochromatic.png";
---

<section id="AboutMe">
    <div class="AboutMe">
        <div class="aboutMeImage">
            <img src={imageRocket.src} alt="about-me image" />
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h2 data-i18n="about.title">About me</h2>
            <p data-i18n="about.p1">I'm a full-stack developer who builds web systems for real operations: inventory platforms, integrations with legacy systems, and SaaS products, from the database to the interface.</p>
            <!-- <p data-i18n="about.p2">I care about software that people rely on every day, so I focus on clean data, clear interfaces, and code that's easy to maintain.</p> -->
            <p data-i18n="about.p3">Outside of work, I run a home server where I experiment with Linux, networking, and self-hosting, using Cloudflare Tunnel to expose services securely.</p>
            <ul class="facts">
                <li data-i18n="about.years">5+ years building web applications</li>
                <li><strong data-i18n="about.dailyLabel">Day-to-day stack:</strong> React, TypeScript, C#/.NET, SQL Server, NestJS</li>
                <li><strong data-i18n="about.alsoLabel">Also worked with:</strong> Python/Django, Next.js, Astro, MongoDB, AWS</li>
                <li data-i18n="about.languages">Fluent in English and Spanish</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    section {
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 40px 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        background-color: var(--surface);
        color: var(--text);
        width: 100vw;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background-attachment: fixed;
    }
    .AboutMe {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        justify-content: space-around;
        align-items: center;
        width: 60%;
    }
    .aboutMeImage {
        width: 45%;
    }

    img {
        width: 100%;
    }
    .content {
        width: 45%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
    }
    h2 {
        font-size: 30px;
    }
    p {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    }
    .facts {
        margin: 8px 0 0 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }
    @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
        h2 {
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
        h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
        }
        .AboutMe {
            flex-direction: column-reverse;
        }
        .content {
            width: 80%;
            height: auto;
        }
        .aboutMeImage {
            width: 60%;
            height: 40%;
        }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 425px) {

        h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .content {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }
        .aboutMeImage {
            width: 100%;

            height: 40%;
        }
    }
    @media screen and (max-width: 320px) {
    }
</style>
